{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t東華三院黃大仙醫院一間護養病房，再多4名男病人帶有耳念珠菌，現正接受隔離治療，情況穩定。<br/>\n<br/>\n院方表示，4名病人年齡介乎44歲至72歲，無出現感染病徵。院方繼續對病人的緊密接觸者展開追蹤篩查，已將有關個案呈報醫院管理局總辦事處及衞生防護中心跟進。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：陳樂謙\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T22:47:12.864034+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":128,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T13:11:08+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T05:57:33.632265+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T22:40:45.326231+00:00","content_hash":"e5f814d89db4e22faa7144042ef92067364b8568251c4339d026d28bff4c51df","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}